@tradition garden-picnic
// Garden picnic (FX14, 0.92.5 item 16; SW1's pitch, the user's yes 2026-10-24): Saturday lunch in paper parcels, eaten in
// the garden just before the garden hour. On the garden's EXISTING benches and the beds' edges, no new seats (the user's
// rule: extra meal seats only inside the mess). The crew have no lunch in the sim, so it isn't a meal: for you, a parcel
// fills you up (its join, section 18's slot). Behind WEEKEND_ON.
k: 466
title: Garden picnic
when: weekly saturday
at: 13:00-13:50
min: 20
jitter: 10
where: 3 room Hydroponics garden: garden, ids ^3-garden-
where: 3 pool garden-tend
where: 3 pool @stretch-garden
hold: 1
