== mail
- Picnic in the garden tomorrow at one. Lunch is in parcels at the servery. Benches are by the tree. Mind the beds.

== ask
- Picnic in the garden at one? Brennan's doing parcels.
- Lunch under the big tree today. Grab a parcel.

== here
- Mind the beds. The basil has feelings.   #funny
- Swap you half my parcel for your apple.

== thanks
- You take a paper parcel and eat lunch on a bench under the big tree, someone lying on their back looking up into the leaves.

== chatter
- Garden picnic tomorrow. Brennan wraps the parcels like presents.
